WEBVTT

00:03:58.788 --> 00:04:01.951
and it's about ensuring
that each one of us

00:04:01.975 --> 00:04:03.646
is part of the process.

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:07.483
A million trees
will not fix climate change.

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:12.848
But they will reduce the risk
of landslides and flooding,

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:17.746
and they will reintroduce biodiversity --

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:21.213
I've already seen
the butterflies back in the park.

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:25.376
And they will protect
our water catchments.

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:30.586
A million trees
is our city's small contribution